<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine posts $842.9 mln trade deficit Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Ukraine posts $842.9 mln trade deficit Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of $842.9 million in the first nine months of the year, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>UKRAINE MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Sept 96  Jan-Aug 96  Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p> Exports (bln $)		 10.125	9.280	 8.040</p>
<p> Imports (bln $)		 10.968	9.865	 7.738</p>
<p> Balance (million $)	   -842.9	-585.3	+302.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for trade with all countries. Trade with former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $1.17 billion.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
